# stow ignore list for the aerospace package.
#
# NOTE: this file REPLACES stow's built-in defaults, so the standard entries are
# repeated below — dropping them would start stowing .git metadata and editor
# backups into $HOME.
#
# templates/ is the git source of truth that render-aerospace.sh reads to produce
# .config/aerospace/aerospace.toml. It is repo-internal; stowing it would create
# a stray ~/templates symlink that nothing reads.
^/templates

# --- stow defaults, preserved ---
RCS
.+,v
CVS
\.\#.+
\.cvsignore
\.svn
_darcs
\.hg
\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules
.+~
\#.*\#
^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING
